3. REPRESENTATIONS.
(a) The Seller represents and warrants that:
    (i) The financial statements provided to Buyer are true, complete, and accurately reflect the financial condition of the Company as of their respective dates;
    (ii) Seller has good and marketable title to the Shares, free of any liens or encumbrances;
    (iii) All required corporate actions to effect the sale have been duly taken.
(b) The Buyer represents and warrants that it has full power and authority to enter into and perform this Agreement.
